WEBVTT

00:32:27.888 --> 00:32:32.808
And it was only when Deng Xiaoping
said let some people get rich first,

00:32:32.832 --> 00:32:34.546
that gave people the opportunity.

00:32:34.570 --> 00:32:37.246
So the gate opened 40 years ago.

00:32:37.270 --> 00:32:39.015
And the child was born.

00:32:39.039 --> 00:32:42.175
And is in a single-child family,

00:32:42.199 --> 00:32:48.799
so that this child is expected
to provide for his or her two parents

00:32:48.823 --> 00:32:50.276
and four grandparents.

00:32:50.300 --> 00:32:52.887
There are no other grandchildren
to provide for them.

00:32:52.911 --> 00:32:58.706
And if their families were to ever
be lifted out of poverty,

00:32:58.730 --> 00:33:00.285
it would be up to them.